ter hands while folding out worse ones.\n\n**Reason:** \nThe passive action from both players suggests neither has a strong hand. My pair of Aces with King kicker is likely good or competitive. Betting would likely only get called by better hands (AK, two pair) while worse hands fold. Checking allows me to see showdown with a hand that has reasonable equity without risking additional chips in a marginal spot.\n\n**Answer:** 0"}
